  "body": "To view/download the property documents use the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/ZPK2\r\n\r\nThe owners have packed their bags, their next move is underway, and their motivation couldn't be clearer. Opportunities like this in one of Orewa's most tightly held streets are becoming incredibly rare, and with this level of motivation, now is the time to act.\r\n\r\nSet on a superb 753sqm (more or less) freehold site, this single-level brick and tile home offers the chance to secure a premium location today while unlocking enormous potential for tomorrow. Whether you move straight in, renovate, or create something truly special, it's the site that makes this opportunity so exciting.\r\n\r\nImagine starting your mornings with a walk along the estuary, grabbing a coffee in the village, spending the afternoon in your garden, catching up with friends nearby, then finishing the day with fish and chips on Orewa Beach. At sought-after Edgewater Grove, that lifestyle isn't a dream - it's your everyday reality.\r\n\r\nPositioned with just one direct neighbour and reserve land stretching to the estuary at your boundary, this is a setting that offers an exceptional sense of space, privacy and tranquillity that is becoming harder and harder to find.\r\n\r\nInside, the home is warm, comfortable and filled with natural light. A modern kitchen connects effortlessly with the open-plan living and dining areas, flowing outdoors to sunny entertaining spaces on both the eastern and northern sides. Enjoy peaceful reserve views while soaking up the sun throughout the day.\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms are serviced by a spacious bathroom, while a study nook offers the exciting possibility of creating a future ensuite, adding even more value over time.\r\n\r\nThe oversized internal-access garage stretches almost nine metres in length, providing outstanding storage, workshop space or room for all the toys.\r\n\r\nProperties in Edgewater Grove rarely become available, and with vendors this committed, this could represent one of the best buying opportunities you'll see in this location. Don't wait for the next open home if you've been searching for a premium Orewa address-this one deserves your immediate attention.\r\n\r\nWhether you're downsizing, retiring, or simply looking for a home that offers an outstanding lifestyle in a tightly held location, this is an opportunity well worth your attention.",
